sysible-obsidian-installer (0.1.0) sysible; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: fetch + install Obsidian from the official vendor release at
    setup time, so it can be offered as a checkbox on the Optional-apps page
    instead of a desktop launcher. Includes a one-shot first-boot retry service.

